stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Produced

    Produced: Produced\n(read from Kaggle CSV)
    Encrypted: Encrypted\n(Fernet AES-128-CBC + HMAC-SHA256)
    Published: Published to Kafka\n(topic: payments)
    Decrypted: Decrypted\n(Job1 · bronze/ written)
    Validated: Validated\n(Job2 · 9 ISO/structural rules passed)
    Normalized: Normalized & Enriched\n(Job3 · silver/ written, ISO 4217/MCC/scheme)
    Optimized: Scored & Deduplicated\n(Job4 · gold/ written, risk score, ValueState dedup)
    Synced: Synced to Data Mart\n(gold-sink → fact_transactions UPSERT)
    Rejected: Rejected\n(routed to payments.dlq with reason code)

    Produced --> Encrypted
    Encrypted --> Published
    Published --> Decrypted : Fernet token valid
    Published --> Rejected : InvalidToken / tampered

    Decrypted --> Validated : passes MTI, amount,\ncurrency, Luhn checks
    Decrypted --> Rejected : fails any of 9 rules\n(reason code attached)

    Validated --> Normalized
    Normalized --> Optimized
    Optimized --> Synced

    Synced --> [*]
    Rejected --> [*]

    note right of Rejected
